{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a party to crawl through waves of enemies in a futuristic fantasy setting with a hint of cosmic horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Level up, equip gear, and reconfigure your party to create powerful synergies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each unit has its own deck of ability cards that determine the flow of battle. Mix and match with items to create an unstoppable force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock and pick from a large variety of unique classes, each with its own signature skills and specialized ability cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gain experience to unlock each unit's skill tree to increase your party's power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pick Fates which have symmetrical battle effects that make every crawl a unique experience. Choose wisely to take advantage of your strengths while minimizing the enemy's weaknesses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Scale your rewards and your difficulty with Stress levels which add unique enemy modifiers. Take it easy or push your limits, it's your choice.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679840?t=1739835846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679840?t=1739835846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739835846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739835846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a party to crawl through waves of enemies in a futuristic fantasy setting with a hint of cosmic horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Level up, equip gear, and reconfigure your party to create powerful synergies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each unit has its own deck of ability cards that determine the flow of battle. Mix and match with items to create an unstoppable force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock and pick from a large variety of unique classes, each with its own signature skills and specialized ability cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gain experience to unlock each unit's skill tree to increase your party's power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pick Fates which have symmetrical battle effects that make every crawl a unique experience. Choose wisely to take advantage of your strengths while minimizing the enemy's weaknesses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Scale your rewards and your difficulty with Stress levels which add unique enemy modifiers. Take it easy or push your limits, it's your choice.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pew Times Three"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679840/header.jpg?t=1739835846","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257064300,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064300/movie480.mp4?t=1728692030","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064300/movie_max.mp4?t=1728692030"},"name":"Playtest Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257064300/6d3822d6ab5550ab4c3bf6619736cb824ceca624/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728692030","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064300/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1728692030","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto